.\" -*- mode: nroff -*-
.TH MIMO 1 "2026-07-03" "mimo 0.1.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mimo \- AI-powered CLI coding agent by Xiaomi MiMo Team
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mimo
.RI [ project ]
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B mimo run
.RI [ message ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B MiMo Code
is an AI-powered CLI coding agent built by the Xiaomi MiMo Team.
It reads code, searches text, edits files, and runs commands,
integrating with the MiMo API and other compatible providers.
.PP
With no arguments, starts an interactive TUI session.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B completion
Generate shell completion script.
.TP
.B acp
Start ACP (Agent Client Protocol) server.
.TP
.B mcp
Manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers.
.TP
.B run
Run MiMo Code with a message (non-interactive).
.TP
.B providers
Manage AI providers and credentials.
.RS
.TP
.B login
Log in to a provider.
.TP
.B logout
Log out from a provider.
.TP
.B list
List configured providers.
.TP
.B whoami
Show current user info.
.RE
.TP
.B agent
Manage agents.
.RS
.TP
.B create
Create a new agent.
.TP
.B list
List available agents.
.RE
.TP
.B upgrade
Upgrade to latest or specific version.
.TP
.B uninstall
Uninstall MiMo Code.
.TP
.B serve
Start a headless server.
.TP
.B models
List available models.
.TP
.B stats
Show token usage and cost statistics.
.TP
.B session
Manage sessions.
.TP
.B db
Database tools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-m " MODEL, " \-\-model " MODEL"
Model to use in provider/model format.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-continue
Continue the last session.
.TP
.BR \-s " ID, " \-\-session " ID"
Session ID to continue.
.TP
.B \-\-agent
Agent to use.
.TP
.B \-\-never-ask
Auto-decide without asking.
.TP
.B \-\-trust
Skip workspace trust prompt.
.TP
.BR \-\-port " PORT"
Port to listen on.
.TP
.BR \-\-hostname " HOST"
Hostname to listen on.
.TP
.B \-\-mdns
Enable mDNS service discovery.
.TP
.B \-\-no-auth
Allow without authentication.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/mimocode/
Session data and database.
.TP
.I ~/.mimocode/
Installation directory with binary and plugins.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR claude (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Xiaomi MiMo Team.
.PP
.UR https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code
.UE
